cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite this repository and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "TNumbersLean: Lean 4 verification for Normality in Mahler's Class of T-Numbers"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Marques
    given-names: Diego
repository-code: "https://github.com/DiegoMarquesMath/TNumbersLean"
url: "https://github.com/DiegoMarquesMath/TNumbersLean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization accompanying the manuscript Normality in Mahler's Class
  of T-Numbers. The repository formally verifies Proposition 3.2 from the stated
  Section 2 external algebraic-approximation inputs and machine-checks selected
  quantitative steps in the Fourier and digit-block constructions.
